<mxCell id="r1264" value="row 0 is the base case: 1 way only when nothing is left to roll (green). Each other cell sums 6 cells of the row above: ways(left − 1, remaining − face)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="324" width="520" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="r1265" value="orange: ways(2, 7) = 6 and ways(3, 10) = 27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="368" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="r1266" value="&lt;b&gt;Checklist&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. what changes between calls?&lt;br&gt;2. does the answer depend on anything else (a flag, the last choice)? add it&lt;br&gt;3. anything that doesn&#x27;t affect the answer (the path so far)? remove it" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="112" width="260" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="r1267" value="Time = states × work per state = (dice × target) × 6. The state is the memo key top-down and the table index bottom-up." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="400" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
